[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5195931265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5195931265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5195931265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNbOegQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T18:48:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T18:48:19Z","body":"The purpose of `serve.py` is to be a fire-and-forget way to host the web editor/template locally for testing. Could we automate the self-signed certificate creation from it? Either calling openssl directly, or using the python `cryptography` library (but I assume it may be less common a dependency than having openssl installed, at least on Linux).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5195931265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5204191381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5204191381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5204191381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNjGolQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T11:43:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T11:43:16Z","body":"> Could we automate the self-signed certificate creation from it?\r\n\r\nYes, but neither `openssl` nor `cryptography` is always installed. So not sure if calling it directly is any more convenient than running in HTTP mode if no keys found and printing a message.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5204191381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5204295343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5204295343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5204295343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNjM-rw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T11:54:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T11:55:20Z","body":"I was thinking we could do something like:\r\n```\r\nif cert.pem:\r\n   use it\r\nelif openssl available:\r\n   generate cert.pem and use it\r\nelse:\r\n   HTTP\r\n```\r\n\r\nI wouldn't bother with `cryptography`, from a quick look it's quite some boilerplate for something that's just a convenience to avoid having to copy-paste and run the `openssl` command given in `print`.\r\n\r\nBut the PR is probably good enough as is, I'm not sure it's worth adding more code for what I suggest (unless it's <5 lines).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5204295343/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5206279308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5206279308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5206279308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNlGEjA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T14:44:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T14:44:47Z","body":"Actually testing this, I get a scare warning from Firefox:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d410745-a9a3-4386-a593-ba9e80b69b11\" />\r\n\r\nSimilar with Chromium:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"376\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6222525a-147d-40e9-b37e-1897cbc0d7a7\" />\r\n\r\nBoth can be bypassed with Advanced > Proceed anyway.\r\n\r\nBut that might come as a surprise as the default behavior in the end.\r\nMaybe generating the cert automatically should be behind a flag like `-s, --self-signed`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5206279308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5246344119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5246344119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5246344119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOLTbtw","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T21:39:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T21:41:00Z","body":"Worth pointing out that by generating the `key.pem` in the `bin/` folder makes it accessible via the HTTP server itself.\r\n\r\nThis means anyone can download it and impersonate the server.\r\n\r\nAlso, this makes this the default/only option, and annoyed users will try to add the certificate to the trust chain at some point (the browser might still keep prompting the error since the domain name will not match, but that depends on the browser).\r\n\r\nIf the browser doesn't let you it's super annoying that now you have to always accept the damn thing on localhost.\r\n\r\nIf the browser let you, it's super dangerous because you are neutralizing TLS to your host, making MITM attacks possible by just downloading the key.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5246344119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5956760071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5956760071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5956760071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYwzyBw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T16:32:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T16:32:22Z","body":"> Worth pointing out that by generating the key.pem in the bin/ folder makes it accessible via the HTTP server itself.\r\n\r\nCan we generate it in a temporary path like `%TEMP%` on Windows and `/tmp` on other platforms? (On non-Windows platforms, we'd probably also `chmod 600` the file just in case.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5956760071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5960009714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122115#issuecomment-5960009714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122115","id":5960009714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYz6H8g","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T19:36:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T19:36:23Z","body":"@calinou see #124109","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5960009714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]